{
  "name": "Your Google Sheets Sync, Fixed and Bulletproofed",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - THE DATA COMES IN\n\nWhatever feeds the sheet lands here, one record at a time, so every run can be replayed against the exact payload that broke it.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "0b0d1517-fe5b-5e1d-8737-e77eecfed0a1",
      "name": "Section - 1 - THE DATA COMES IN",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - THE FIVE THINGS THAT BREAK SHEETS SYNCS\n\nWrong types, empty rows, a renamed tab, a moved header, and appending when it should update. Each one gets its own guard before a single cell is written.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 1180,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "3862852b-457f-5d4a-ba40-01f5bc105372",
      "name": "Section - 2 - THE FIVE THINGS THAT BREAK SHEETS SYNCS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        320,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - WRITE IT THE RIGHT WAY\n\nMatched on a key column, so the same record updates its row instead of quietly stacking duplicates at the bottom of the sheet.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "bb5661b3-885d-5a87-a76e-fe5270027823",
      "name": "Section - 3 - WRITE IT THE RIGHT WAY",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1660,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - QUOTA AND AUTH GUARDS\n\nGoogle throttles bursts and OAuth tokens expire. A failed write backs off, refreshes the credential, and retries instead of dying silently.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "14a62d02-bcbb-513a-bac5-4c2816c95609",
      "name": "Section - 4 - QUOTA AND AUTH GUARDS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2040,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 - PROVE IT KEEPS WORKING\n\nA heartbeat row on a log tab shows the sync is alive, and any node that fails names itself and the row it was on.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "398653e0-167d-5ec1-87d8-d687bff423f9",
      "name": "Section - 5 - PROVE IT KEEPS WORKING",
